{"3985380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Balloon Full of Love", "steam_appid": 3985380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about love. It is the story of a young inventor trying to reach the girl he has fallen in love with through the power of her music. You guide a red balloon through the maze of city streets, hunting for fuel to reach the sheets of music flying through the wind. And with every sheet you catch, you advance the story of love, loss and redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloon Full of Love is set in a stylized, classic 1930’s Art Deco cityscape, and features an original score by composer Robert Bünsow.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about love. It is the story of a young inventor trying to reach the girl he has fallen in love with through the power of her music. You guide a red balloon through the maze of city streets, hunting for fuel to reach the sheets of music flying through the wind. And with every sheet you catch, you advance the story of love, loss and redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloon Full of Love is set in a stylized, classic 1930’s Art Deco cityscape, and features an original score by composer Robert Bünsow.</p>", "short_description": "This is a single player story driven arcade game about the power of love.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985380/064268a1ca74d767bb16e3e27a90335ba2000ec8/header.jpg?t=1765527036", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985380/5360674078f3b2eba34f1830b74f3c30c74b4bea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765527036", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_